  "bedside": {
    "description": "RGB LED colours and levels (0 to 100). Warm only, never blue, never a flash. Dawn level stays 60 until the bedside hardware owner confirms 70 without glare from the lying position (Decisions L5). Quiet night caps every level at 25.",
